2026-11-06T03:09:02.4900160Z [0m
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4902467Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4903054Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4903930Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4904420Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4905307Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4905640Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4905968Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4906869Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4907119Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4907701Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4908379Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4909331Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4909734Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4910034Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4910284Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4910576Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4910813Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4911315Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4911464Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4911603Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4911794Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4912156Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4912762Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4913032Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4913158Z I will:
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4913395Z 
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4913738Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4914232Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4915098Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4915671Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4915997Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4916421Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4916923Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4917324Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4923769Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4924396Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4932936Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4933523Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:09:02.4933805Z 
